It carries two data files from Polaris (https://github.com/EgorKhaklin/polaris-id),
lab/interop/negative-vectors, byte for byte: vectors.json and mdoc-vectors.json.
manifest.json names each file's version, size and SHA-256. The keys and
certificates inside the files are test material derived from public seeds.
